 r"A general curved-spacetime extension is a broad programme, but a precise self-dual curved construction already existed before this lecture. It is therefore inaccurate to read the sentence as denying every curved twistor correspondence.",
 r"The nonlinear-graviton construction concerns constrained complex/self-dual geometry; it is not a solution for all real Lorentzian Einstein metrics.",
